<div class="container">
  <div class="columns content">
    <div class="column is-12 has-text-centered">
      <h3 class="is-size-3">
        How It Works
      </h3>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="columns content">

    <div class="column is-3">
      <div class="media">
        <div class="media-content">

          <div>
            <div class="icon is-size-5 is-large mb-4 has-text-centered">
              <i class="fas fa-2x fa-spider"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="is-size-4">CRAWL</h4>
          </div>

          <p>
            Our <strong>crawlers</strong> routinely visit top websites
            and third-party website archives.
          </p>

          <p>
            We <strong>detect</strong> third-party experimentation
            snippets or cookie data that suggest active
            experimentation.
          </p>

          <p>
            And <strong>extract</strong> relevant experiment
            information and associated metadata.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="column is-offset-1 is-3">
      <div class="media">

        <div class="media-content">
          <div>
            <div class="icon is-large is-size-5 mb-4">
              <i class="fas fa-2x fa-robot"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="is-size-4">RENDER</h4>
          </div>

          <p>
            We run a cluster of <strong>headless browser</strong> instances.
          </p>

          <p>
            To <strong>render</strong> the previously collected
            experimentation data.
          </p>

          <p>
            And generate textual and visual
            <strong>diffs</strong> from the original
            website.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="column is-offset-1 is-3 ">
      <div class="media">

        <div class="media-content">
          <div>
            <div class="icon is-large is-size-5 mb-4">
              <i class="fas fa-2x fa-tags"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="is-size-4">SUMMARIZE</h4>
          </div>

          <p>
            We employ a number of <strong>Natural Language
            Processing</strong> techniques.
          </p>

          <p>
            Textual and visual differences are used as inputs to
            <strong>label</strong> and <strong>summarize</strong>
            variations and experiments.
          </p>

          <p>We try our best.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
